metadata.description:
{\rtf1\ansi\deff0
{\pard\sa180 A visual, screenshot-based plugin browser for REAPER. Build a curated plugin library, organize it into groups, search, and insert plugins by clicking or dragging.\par}
{\pard\sa180 ReaImGui is required. js_ReaScriptAPI is optional and enables automated screenshot capture.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0
{\pard\sa180 Reaper Plugin Picker is a visual plugin browser for REAPER. It includes a curated library, custom groups, plugin search, grid and list views, and screenshot support.\par}
{\pard\sa180 ReaImGui is required. js_ReaScriptAPI is optional for automated screenshots.\par}
}
